      "special_notes": "Dwarves cannot wear human-sized equipment without modification. They are exceptionally tough (highest EP modifier) and resistant to magic and disease. They cannot swim (Inaptitude Swimming). Dwarf Stature means they are smaller and require specially-made equipment.",
