      },
      "special_notes": "Elves are full casters (Vollzauberer) by racial heritage. Metal armor interferes with their magic. They cannot drink alcohol (Inaptitude Drinking). Sensitive Smell 6 is automatic and can cause problems in cities or near strong odors. The Vollzauberer advantage provides +12 ASP and the RM modifier given is inclusive of the Vollzauberer bonus. Only the Lea Elves culture is available in the Basic Rules.",
